---
title: Browser extension · authenticated binding before presentation
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box Participant's Chrome
    participant tab as Session tab
    participant worker as Extension service worker
    participant surface as Bound preview surface
    participant sdk as Embedded browser SDK
  end
  participant cp as Control plane

  Note over tab: Voice and<br/>session controls
  tab->>worker: single-use binding offer
  Note over worker,sdk: The participant focuses the preview tab.
  worker->>sdk: page-proof probe
  sdk-->>worker: forwarded page proof
  Note over sdk: Signed by telemetry ingestion.<br/>Client + session + allocation.<br/>Document + protocol identity.
  worker->>cp: binding_offer + forwarded proof, on the control connection
  Note right of cp: Checks the offer, proof,<br/>and device-key possession.<br/>Policy + user permissions.
  cp-->>worker: one binding · extension_binding_id
  worker->>surface: render Rive character + controls
  loop each committed change
    cp->>worker: pushed state + authorized Command, by revision
    Note right of cp: Checks current target,<br/>phase, and budget
    worker->>surface: route to the bound content surface
    opt visual Command
      surface->>sdk: validate target
      sdk-->>surface: exact target · fresh geometry + revision
      Note over surface: Cursor + overlays
      surface-->>worker: Command result
      worker-->>cp: terminal outcome
    end
  end
